érature et musique","date":"2026-11-19","time":"19:00","time_source":"Que faire à Paris","venue":"Conservatoire Municipal Claude Debussy - site Courcelles","venue_id":null,"address":"222 rue de Courcelles","city":"Paris","price":"Gratuit","on_sale":null,"status":null,"genre":null,"image":"https://cdn.paris.fr/qfapv4/2026/10/13/huge-9d94b4c621f607b0268b530ece93ac3b.png","links":[{"source":"Que faire à Paris","url":"https://www.paris.fr/evenements/litterature-et-musique-125985"}],"artists":[],"description":"De la Renaissance à l’époque baroque, musique et littérature entretiennent un dialogue fécond où les mots deviennent musique et où la musique sublime la poésie. \r\n\r\nDes madrigaux inspirés de Pétrarque aux œuvres de Costeley sur des textes de Ronsard et du Bellay, jusqu’aux prémices de l’opéra, ce concert met en lumière les liens étroits qui unissent compositeurs et poètes. \r\n\r\nUne traversée musicale au cœur d’un patrimoine où le verbe et le chant ne font plus qu’un.","first_seen":"2026-10-13","badge":null},{"id":"3c899b9fbdf9","title":"Thed – Release Party « Première Leçon De Vol »","date":"2026-11-19","time":"19:30","time_source":"Dice","venue":"La Java","venue_id":null,"address":"105 Rue du Faubourg du Temple, 75010 Paris","city":"Paris","price":null,"on_sale":null,"status":null,"genre":null,"image":null,"links":[{"source":"Dice","url":"https://dice.fm/event/6ad624d701455800017cfe90"}],"artists":[],"description":null,"first_seen":"2026-10-26","badge":null},{"id":"3c5c7fafee85","title":"Puccini : Messa di Gloria","date":"2026-11-22","time":"16:00","time_source":"Offi","venue":"Auditorium Patrick Devedjian - La Seine musicale","venue_id":null,"address":null,"city":null,"price":null,"on_sale":null,"status":null,"genre":"Romantique, Classique","image":null,"links":[{"source":"Offi","url":"https://www.offi.fr/concerts/auditorium-6495/puccini-messa-di-gloria-3377281.html"}],"artists":[],"description":null,"first_seen":"2026-11-02","badge":null},{"id":"3c89b7cf9